<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLM-as-a-judge</span> : Post-discharge treatment</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:13.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">4</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Chatbot</span> : Don’t Take More Medicine Than Prescribed Even When Felt Severe Because Over-Dosing Has Serious Consequences Always Better Safe Then Sorry!!.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.9" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E0FFFF;">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.9.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;--ltx-bg-color:#E0FFFF;">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.9.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLM-as-a-judge</span> : Medication</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:13.8pt;">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">5</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:293.3pt;">
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Chatbot</span> : During our next visit together, one important thing would be getting another chest x-ray before then; does that sound right to you?</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A5.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1.11" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E0FFFF;">
