<span id="A6.T10.2.1.3.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:172.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T10.2.1.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The agent asked appropriate questions and listened actively; however, encouraging more open-ended responses would deepen understanding of the patient’s concerns.</span>
</span></td></tr>
