<span id="A6.T10.2.1.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:172.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T10.2.1.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The agent provided clear and understandable instructions, but occasional jargon and complex phrasing detracted from clarity.</span>
</span></td></tr>
