</span></td>
<td id="A6.T10.2.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A6.T10.2.1.6.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:172.5pt;">
<span id="A6.T10.2.1.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The agent provided useful advice but could further enhance the patient’s autonomy by discussing self-management strategies more explicitly.</span>
</span></td></tr>
